# Build/install detritus from the client parity checks (check-clients.sh).
# The clients ship SOURCE only: generated DTOs, the canonical encoder, examples,
# and packaging manifests. Everything below is produced by npm install / pip
# install -e and must never be committed or published.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
